WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:04.917
When the Conjunction happened,

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:07.333
it wasn't just the elves.

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:09.792
Humans, dwarfs…

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:12.833
Spheres of beasts collided too.

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:16.458
Then, 300 years ago,

00:00:17.042 --> 00:00:18.917
mages weaponized men,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.292
made them fast,

00:00:20.792 --> 00:00:21.833
strong,

00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:25.042
brutal enough to kill the beasts.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.833
The witchers

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:31.833
saved humanity from extinction.

00:00:36.542 --> 00:00:37.792
This is your home?

00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:40.000
How many did you say there were?

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:42.500
There were 20.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:43.417
Now?

00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:44.958
Maybe less.

00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:50.875
A witcher is a trained killer.

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:52.958
Professional monster hunter.

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:56.917
Witchers have that
heightened sense of things.

00:00:57.917 --> 00:00:59.750
They came in as very young,

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:02.792
and they're transformed
to get unhuman power.

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:06.208
Trained to such an extreme

00:01:06.292 --> 00:01:08.292
that they are no longer
really human.

00:01:08.917 --> 00:01:11.667
To fight against
beasts and monsters.

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:15.042
We thought you got lost. Or killed.

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:17.042
Not yet. Sorry.

00:01:17.625 --> 00:01:18.708
Brother!

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.875
Kaer Morhen is the keep
of the witchers,

00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:23.083
the School of the Wolf.

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:26.125
The witchers descend there
every winter

00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:28.625
to feel rooted to a family.

00:01:29.542 --> 00:01:31.500
The only family
that they really know.

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:32.875
He's home!

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:37.333
Who the hell are you?

00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:41.083
He takes Ciri there to protect her.
It is the safest place he knows.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.375
Stay here.

00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:45.583
I brought her here so she'd be safe.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.875
It's easier for me to protect her
within these walls.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.750
It's hard to do when I don't know
who I'm protecting her from.

00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:56.417
Vesemir, he is the leader
of the witchers,

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.375
and Ciri has a lot of respect for him.

00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:01.500
You're impressing
all of us out there.

00:02:02.083 --> 00:02:05.250
There's a brotherhood there.
They're not bound by blood.

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:08.083
They're bound together
by the sacrifices they've made.

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:11.958
Neither you nor I
can just forget who we are.

00:02:13.417 --> 00:02:14.750
It's one of those wonderful things

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:18.000
where you have
the big, complex worlds,

00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:20.375
and in that,
you get to tell really humble,

00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:22.250
really simple human stories.

00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:24.292
-Who's ready?
-Eskel!

00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:27.708
It's about family
and exploring what family means,

00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:30.917
which is, I think,
what the witchers represent.

00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:33.625
Do what you do best.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.833
Stay and fight.

